(text "WIZ850io: one footprint with both 1x6 sockets (J1 = pads 1-6, J2 = pads 7-12), rows 17.78 mm (0.7 in) apart." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 54d152cf-ce6f-4f65-9548-b805b8d6fd95))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 739a5a7c-c021-407d-ba01-164df96066e4))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ad05e634-c15b-4e53-9539-513e06b8901b))
(text "Fast lines (SPI, SD) have no test points: probe them at the WIZ850io and microSD pins." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid aef94146-0ab8-4d71-9c1c-d560f9c6e613))
